{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466160/extras/077b2de02498fd992815cd17ffe092f8.poster.avif?t=1750970330\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466160/extras/077b2de02498fd992815cd17ffe092f8.webm?t=1750970330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466160/extras/077b2de02498fd992815cd17ffe092f8.mp4?t=1750970330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You may know RunMan from his appearance as a playable character in <i>Super Meat Boy</i>. Or you are a true indie gaming hipster and know him from even earlier.<br><br>An epic collaboration between Tom Sennett (<i>Deepak Fights Robots</i>) and Maddy Thorson (<i>TowerFall</i>, <i>Celeste</i>), <strong>RunMan: Race Around the World</strong> is a platformer with an emphasis on speed and flow.<br><br>To get a good score on each course, you have to run through it really fast without stopping. The actual scoring is a bit more complex than that, but that's basically it.<br><br>You can't die, because dying's not fun.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466160/extras/473e63211adc4a72056eadaba133b051.poster.avif?t=1750970330\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466160/extras/473e63211adc4a72056eadaba133b051.webm?t=1750970330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466160/extras/473e63211adc4a72056eadaba133b051.mp4?t=1750970330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Run through 35+ levels across 6 unique and preposterous zones!<br></li><li>Complete ridiculous feats of speed to earn shiny medals!<br></li><li>Unlock 4 lovable secret characters and probably some other stuff!<br></li><li>Colorful, bright, crude, colorful graphics!<br></li><li>Classic tunes of phonograph-era folk, blues, jazz, and more!<br></li><li>You can't die!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466160/extras/a98219b7cf2026de01b1e15f2a0259f3.poster.avif?t=1750970330\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466160/extras/a98219b7cf2026de01b1e15f2a0259f3.webm?t=1750970330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466160/extras/a98219b7cf2026de01b1e15f2a0259f3.mp4?t=1750970330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This is a port of the original RunMan: Race Around the World (released in 2009), which fixes a number of technical issues that were encountered on modern systems. It's been optimized to support all kinds of screen sizes, and gamepads, and it has an overhauled audio system to keep everything <i>running </i>smoothly. All the game's original art, gameplay, and content are here!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Kick Off The Wall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2466160/ff0ceb0e4fe4fa28f6e61793e0c852b9b812fb33.jpg"},{"name":"Bronze","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2466160/e20ac1d7f98a1131959a5777fc1d1e9759586f3d.jpg"},{"name":"Best Pal ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2466160/452e46b0f624999b2ebed65e77cde1620f4bd06a.jpg"},{"name":"Dive ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2466160/ba156968019daa409e4e92b448be6396d5eb5401.jpg"},{"name":"The sleepy heads ","path":"https://c